# Watermarked brand previews from the seller (DesignNoirCo), shown for
# selection only and not licensed for use or distribution. Never commit them:
# committing puts another party's watermarked work into history (a later
# git rm does not remove it), and referencing one ships the watermark to a
# customer. The licensed art lands in public/brand/ when the user delivers it,
# and these three are replaced then. Matched by exact path so public/brand/
# and the real assets are never blocked.
/public/Kens mobile tire logo.jpg
/public/icm_fullxfull.681608358_isz0wre9asgk00wkwsgo.jpg
/public/icm_fullxfull.685139857_m8dvmt2fkxwgo8gs4448.jpg
